  "result": "Done! I've added voucher support to the invoicing system:\n\n**Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` function:**\n- Applies a fixed amount in cents off the invoice, **after VAT**\n- Stores `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n- Only works on **draft invoices** (returns `NOT_DRAFT` otherwise)\n- Only **one voucher per invoice** (returns `VOUCHER_EXISTS` if already has one)\n- Amount must be a **positive integer** in cents (returns `AMOUNT_INVALID` otherwise)\n- Never mutates input invoice\n\n**Updated `invoiceTotals`** to include voucher calculation:\n- Returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n- All amounts clamped to \u2265 0\n\n**Added error code:** `VOUCHER_EXISTS`\n\n**Added 10 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Applying vouchers to draft invoices\n- Voucher calculation in totals\n- Multiple voucher attempts (error handling)\n- Invalid amounts (non-integer, negative, zero)\n- Input immutability\n- Edge cases (voucher equals total amount)\n\nAll 176 tests pass \u2713",
